# The vendored `wit-bindgen` CLI, the C bindings it generates from crates/gg/wit, the third-party
# package sources `build.sh` fetches by tag, the compiled library set, the symbol graph
# `signatures.sh` reflects from, and the staging tree the archives are cut from. Everything this
# package COMMITS lands in crates/gg/src/sandbox/checkers/ and
# crates/gg/src/sandbox/guests/swift.signatures.json instead.
.build/
